# Never commit

Already in `.gitignore` — do not force-add:

- `.env`, `.env.local`
- `config.toml` (local copy with secrets — use `config.toml.example` as template)
- `token.ron`, `*.ron` runtime data (`pings.ron`, `leaderboard.ron`, etc.)
- `./dev-data/`, `./prod-data/`, `/data/`
- `.worktrees/`
- `token.ron`, schedule/leaderboard/ping/memory caches at repo root

Before committing, verify `git status` has no secret-bearing or runtime data files staged.
